package CanvasNet {
    part def DataLoader {
        doc /* The internal DataLoader (a sealed class, one instance per measure or render call, plus a static Load for inline data and sequences only): Load reads the data of a view from its data property and returns a DataTable. The source is chosen by precedence - inline values given as an array (an array of objects gives one row per object; an array of primitives gives one row per value in the field data; JSON types are kept; a nested object or array is flattened to leaf fields named by their canonical path, and a field a row lacks is null), then a relative local url read through DataFileResolver as JSON (the default), CSV, TSV, or DSV (format.type, else the .csv or .tsv extension; format.property selects the rows of a JSON file), then a sequence (start, exclusive stop, step, as), then a name (the caller's datasets before the top-level datasets of the specification). format.parse is applied to every source (inference per column for delimited text by default) and the values that an explicit conversion cannot read are exposed as vl-data-parse-failed warnings. A url that has a scheme or is absolute is remote: the table is empty, nothing is resolved or fetched, and the FeatureCatalog reports vl-data-remote-url; text or object values, a topojson format, and no source are also empty tables reported by the catalog. A local file that is missing or cannot be used, an undefined name, invalid JSON or delimited text, or a limit (MaxDataRows as a total across the tables of the call and checked before any row is converted or allocated, MaxFieldCount, MaxStringLength, and, through the resolver, MaxDataFiles and MaxDataBytes) throws a VegaLiteRenderException with the location of the offending data in lenient and strict mode alike; cancellation is checked every 1,024 rows. */

        comment sourceRef /* Source: src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.VegaLite/Data/DataLoader.cs */
        comment testRef /* Test: test/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.VegaLite.Tests/Data/DataLoaderTests.cs */
        comment designRef /* Design: docs/design/canvas-net-vega-lite/data/data-loader.md */
        comment verificationRef /* Verification: docs/verification/canvas-net-vega-lite/data/data-loader.md */
        comment reqRef /* Requirements: docs/reqstream/canvas-net-vega-lite/data/data-loader.yaml */
    }
}
